abstract: "A reviewer-auditable evidence capsule for NISQ benchmarking, demonstrated on an IBM-only corpus with an author-preserved evaluation plan, content-addressed logical OpenQASM workload identity, provider job-id provenance, negative controls, public ancillary data, replay scripts, and cross-backend analysis."
